      {
        "instruction": "Die Box soll ihren Inhalt in die Mitte schieben, aber nichts passiert. Finde den falschen Wert.",
        "codeTemplate": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"de\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Meine Website</title>\n  <style>\n    .buehne {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: centre;\n      background-color: mistyrose;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"buehne\"><span>🎤 Auftritt!</span></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
        "solution": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"de\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Meine Website</title>\n  <style>\n    .buehne {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background-color: mistyrose;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"buehne\"><span>🎤 Auftritt!</span></div>\n</body>\n</html>",
